{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "navigation-orchestration",
    "version": "1.1.0",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "navigation",
      "orchestration",
      "composition",
      "governance"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": "/docs/navigation-orchestration-docs"
    },
    "changelog": [
      {
        "version": "1.1.0",
        "changes": [
          "Arena aus dem Recipe (RecipeArena, Plan v3, Phase 4, Gruppe bewegung): fuenf Ebenen als echtes Markup, Legenden fuer Token-Kette und Shell-Schichten",
          "full-composition zeigt auch .is-hidden",
          "compact-density: .nc-header--compact nicht gebaut (gemeldet)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "version": "1.0.1",
        "changes": [
          "Anatomie: Slot menu-viewport (.nc-navigation-menu__viewport) entfernt — das Navigationsmenue hat seit Recipe 3.0.0 keinen Viewport, das SCSS gestaltet ihn nicht mehr (Entscheidung 05.10.2026)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "changes": [
          "Initiale Kompositionsregeln: 5-Ebenen-Hierarchie (Shell → Navigation → NavigationMenu → NavMolecules → NavAtoms)",
          "Token-Sync-Map: Single Source of Truth fuer alle Navigations-Tokens",
          "Responsive Orchestrierung: Desktop-Menu ↔ Mobile-Drawer Handshake",
          "Z-Index Governance: Shell vergibt, Navigation/Menu erben",
          "Composition-Specimens: Full Header, Mobile Handoff, Token Cascade"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "layer": "organism",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [],
      "story": "stories/organisms/navigation-orchestration.stories.js",
      "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/RecipeArena.vue",
      "drupal": [],
      "docs": null
    },
    "dependencies": [
      "header",
      "navigation",
      "shell"
    ]
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-header"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "shell-slot",
        "element": ".nc-shell__navbar",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "header",
        "element": ".nc-header",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "nav-inner",
        "element": ".nc-nav__inner",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "brand",
        "element": ".nc-brand",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "menu",
        "element": ".nc-navigation-menu",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "menu-list",
        "element": ".nc-navigation-menu__list",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "menu-item",
        "element": ".nc-navigation-menu__item",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "menu-trigger",
        "element": ".nc-navigation-menu__trigger",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "nav-link",
        "element": ".nc-nav__link",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "nav-icon",
        "element": ".nc-nav__icon",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "nav-label",
        "element": ".nc-nav__label",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "nav-badge",
        "element": ".nc-nav__badge",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "mobile-toggle",
        "element": ".nc-mobile-toggle",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "actions",
        "element": ".nc-nav__actions",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "tools",
        "element": ".nc-tools",
        "optional": true
      }
    ],
    "convenience": [],
    "domNotes": [
      "Ebene 1 — Shell: .nc-shell__navbar Slot reserviert die Grid-Row. nc-shell-z-navbar bestimmt den Z-Index.",
      "Ebene 2 — Navigation: .nc-header fuellt den Shell-Slot. Sticky, Blur, Emphasis, Mobile-Toggle.",
      "Ebene 3 — NavigationMenu: .nc-navigation-menu sitzt in .nc-nav__inner. Steuert Link-Verteilung und Dropdowns.",
      "Ebene 4 — Nav-Molecules: .nc-nav__link wird als Item im Menu gerendert. Shared Hover/Active Tokens.",
      "Ebene 5 — Nav-Atoms: .nc-nav__icon + .nc-nav__label werden innerhalb der Links genutzt. Konsistente 24px Icons.",
      "Mobile: Unterhalb lg wird .nc-navigation-menu ausgeblendet, .nc-mobile-toggle eingeblendet → Shell Drawer.",
      "Mobil-Lage unabhaengig vom Fenster per .nc-header--mobile (Entscheidung 02.10.2026); .is-mobile-open zeigt .nc-mobile-panel.",
      "density compact: .nc-header--compact steht hier, aber nicht in styles.css — die Arena zeigt „nicht gebaut\"."
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "viewport": {
      "label": "Viewport",
      "description": "Responsive Modus — desktop (Navigation-Menu sichtbar), mobile (Hamburger → Drawer)",
      "values": {
        "desktop": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "composition",
            "sync"
          ],
          "renderHint": "nav-orchestration-desktop"
        },
        "mobile": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "composition",
            "mobile"
          ],
          "renderHint": "nav-orchestration-mobile"
        }
      }
    },
    "density": {
      "label": "Density",
      "description": "Gesamtdichte der Navigation — default, compact (reduzierte Hoehe/Gaps)",
      "values": {
        "default": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "nav-density-default"
        },
        "compact": {
          "modifier": "nc-header--compact",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "compact"
          ],
          "renderHint": "nav-density-compact"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "scrolled",
      "hidden",
      "mobile-open"
    ],
    "precedence": [
      "mobile-open",
      "hidden",
      "scrolled",
      "default"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "scrolled",
        "condition": ".is-scrolled — Shadow + volle Opacity (Scroll-Direction: up)"
      },
      {
        "state": "hidden",
        "condition": ".is-hidden — translateY(-100%) (Scroll-Direction: down, Intelligent Sticky)"
      },
      {
        "state": "mobile-open",
        "condition": ".is-mobile-open — Mobile-Panel sichtbar, Hamburger → X Animation"
      }
    ],
    "interactive": true
  },
  "a11y": {
    "base": {
      "interactive": true,
      "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
      "assertions": [
        "hasAccessibleName",
        "supportsKeyboard",
        "hasSkipLink"
      ],
      "note": "Skip-Link am Anfang. nav mit aria-label. Keyboard: Tab durch alle Links, Arrow-Keys in Menu. Mobile: Focus-Trap im Drawer. Roving Tabindex fuer Menu-Items."
    },
    "overrides": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "viewport": [
              "mobile"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "focus-trap",
          "aria-expanded"
        ],
        "note": "Mobile Drawer: Focus-Trap aktiv, Toggle: aria-expanded, Escape schliesst."
      }
    ]
  },
  "constraints": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "skip-link"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Skip-Link: 'Zum Inhalt springen' am Anfang des Headers."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "nav-aria-label"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "<nav aria-label='Hauptnavigation'> auf .nc-nav."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "z-index-from-shell"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Z-Index MUSS von Shell kommen (nc-shell-z-navbar). Niemals hardcoded."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "height-sync"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "nc-nav-height synchronisiert mit Shell Grid-Row und scroll-margin-top fuer Anker-Links."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "copy": {}
  },
  "styling": {
    "baseClasses": [
      "nc-header"
    ],
    "baseTokenGroups": [
      "composition",
      "sync"
    ],
    "tokenGroups": {
      "composition": {
        "label": "Composition Map",
        "description": "Die hierarchische Verschachtelung und ihre Token-Vererbung",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-nav-orch-shell-z-index",
          "nc-nav-orch-height",
          "nc-nav-orch-gap",
          "nc-nav-orch-icon-size",
          "nc-nav-orch-link-hover-bg",
          "nc-nav-orch-link-active-border",
          "nc-nav-orch-viewport-shadow"
        ]
      },
      "sync": {
        "label": "Token Sync Rules",
        "description": "Single Source of Truth — welcher Master-Token auf welche Abhängigen wirkt",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-nav-orch-sync-height",
          "nc-nav-orch-sync-interaction",
          "nc-nav-orch-sync-elevation",
          "nc-nav-orch-sync-spacing"
        ]
      },
      "mobile": {
        "label": "Mobile Orchestration",
        "description": "Responsive Handshake: Desktop-Menu ↔ Mobile-Drawer",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-nav-orch-mobile-breakpoint",
          "nc-nav-orch-mobile-drawer-width"
        ]
      },
      "compact": {
        "label": "Compact Density",
        "description": "Reduzierte Navigationshoehe fuer kompakte Layouts",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-nav-orch-compact-height",
          "nc-nav-orch-compact-gap",
          "nc-nav-orch-compact-padding"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "recipes": {
    "mode": "derived",
    "derive": {
      "from": [
        "axes",
        "states",
        "styling.tokenGroups"
      ],
      "output": [
        "classList",
        "resolvedTokens",
        "a11yAssertions"
      ]
    },
    "resolution": {
      "classList": [
        "styling.baseClasses",
        "axes.density.values.*.modifier"
      ],
      "tokenGroups": [
        "styling.baseTokenGroups",
        "axes.*.values.*.tokenGroups"
      ]
    }
  },
  "orchestration": {
    "hierarchy": [
      {
        "level": 1,
        "component": "shell",
        "recipe": "shell-recipe",
        "slot": ".nc-shell__navbar",
        "provides": {
          "z-index": "nc-shell-z-navbar → nc-nav-z-index",
          "height-slot": "grid-template-rows: var(--nc-nav-height)"
        },
        "note": "Die Shell stellt den Slot und den Z-Index bereit. Die Navigation erbt beides."
      },
      {
        "level": 2,
        "component": "navigation",
        "recipe": "navigation-recipe",
        "slot": ".nc-nav__inner",
        "consumes": [
          "nc-shell-z-navbar"
        ],
        "provides": {
          "container": "Sticky Header mit Backdrop-Blur, Emphasis-Varianten",
          "mobile-toggle": "Hamburger-Button unterhalb lg → Shell Drawer"
        },
        "note": "Verwaltet das globale Header-Verhalten. Emphasis und Sticky sind hier definiert."
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "component": "navigation-menu",
        "recipe": "navigation-menu-recipe",
        "slot": ".nc-navigation-menu__list",
        "consumes": [
          "nc-nav-gap"
        ],
        "provides": {
          "layout": "Link-Verteilung (start/center/right), Dropdown-Viewport, Indicator",
          "viewport": "Dropdown-Container mit nc-popover-shadow"
        },
        "note": "Orchestriert die Link-Liste und die Dropdown-Mechanik. Indicator-Position wird animiert."
      },
      {
        "level": 4,
        "component": "nav-molecules",
        "recipe": "nav-molecules-recipe",
        "consumes": [
          "nc-nav-mol-link-hover-bg"
        ],
        "provides": {
          "interaction": "Hover-BG, Active-Underline, Focus-Ring — wiederverwendbar in Menu-Trigger",
          "mobile": "Vertikales Link-Stacking im Drawer, Toggle-Button"
        },
        "note": "Die interaktiven Einheiten. Hover-BG wird via MIRROR_TOKEN_MAP an navigation-menu__trigger weitergegeben."
      },
      {
        "level": 5,
        "component": "nav-atoms",
        "recipe": "nav-atoms-recipe",
        "provides": {
          "icon": "24px inline-flex SVG Container — stroke via Token",
          "label": "Text-Label mit size/weight/color",
          "badge": "Notification-Dot (roter Punkt mit Ring)"
        },
        "note": "Die kleinsten Einheiten. Icon-Size 24px ist die Baseline fuer die gesamte Navigation."
      }
    ],
    "tokenSync": {
      "description": "Single Source of Truth — Datenfluss der Token-Vererbung",
      "rules": [
        {
          "master": "nc-shell-z-navbar",
          "targets": [
            "nc-nav-z-index"
          ],
          "direction": "shell → navigation",
          "note": "Z-Index kommt immer von der Shell. Navigation darf keinen eigenen Z-Index hardcoden."
        },
        {
          "master": "nc-nav-height",
          "targets": [
            "scroll-margin-top (global)",
            "nc-mega top-offset",
            "nc-search-panel margin-top"
          ],
          "direction": "navigation → global",
          "note": "Die Header-Hoehe bestimmt scroll-margin-top fuer Anker-Links und den Top-Offset aller Overlays."
        },
        {
          "master": "nc-nav-mol-link-hover-bg",
          "targets": [
            "nc-nav-menu-trigger-hover-bg"
          ],
          "direction": "nav-molecules → navigation-menu",
          "note": "Hover-BG: Ein Link in der Hauptleiste und ein Trigger im Dropdown haben denselben Hover."
        },
        {
          "master": "nc-nav-mol-link-active-border",
          "targets": [
            "nc-nav-menu-indicator-color"
          ],
          "direction": "nav-molecules → navigation-menu",
          "note": "Active-Accent: Der Unterstrich am Link und die Indicator-Farbe im Menu sind identisch."
        },
        {
          "master": "nc-nav-atom-icon-color",
          "targets": [
            "nc-nav-mol-link-color"
          ],
          "direction": "nav-atoms → nav-molecules",
          "note": "Icon-Farbe kaskadiert in die Link-Textfarbe — einheitliches Farbschema."
        },
        {
          "master": "nc-popover-shadow",
          "targets": [
            "nc-nav-menu-viewport-shadow"
          ],
          "direction": "popover → navigation-menu",
          "note": "Dropdown-Viewport erbt Shadow vom Popover-System fuer Overlay-Konsistenz."
        },
        {
          "master": "nc-nav-gap",
          "targets": [
            "nc-navigation-menu__list gap"
          ],
          "direction": "navigation → navigation-menu",
          "note": "Der Abstand zwischen Top-Level-Items folgt dem globalen Nav-Gap."
        }
      ]
    },
    "responsiveHandshake": {
      "description": "Desktop ↔ Mobile Umschaltung",
      "breakpoint": "1200px (lg)",
      "rules": [
        {
          "condition": "viewport >= 1200px",
          "behavior": "Desktop",
          "visible": [
            ".nc-navigation-menu",
            ".nc-nav__list",
            ".nc-nav__actions",
            ".nc-tools"
          ],
          "hidden": [
            ".nc-mobile-toggle",
            ".nc-mobile-panel"
          ],
          "note": "Vollstaendiges Navigation-Menu mit Dropdowns, Indicator, Mega-Menu."
        },
        {
          "condition": "viewport < 1200px",
          "behavior": "Mobile",
          "visible": [
            ".nc-mobile-toggle",
            ".nc-brand"
          ],
          "hidden": [
            ".nc-navigation-menu",
            ".nc-nav__list",
            ".nc-nav__actions"
          ],
          "note": "Hamburger-Toggle sichtbar. Klick oeffnet .nc-mobile-panel oder Shell Drawer."
        },
        {
          "condition": "viewport < 960px",
          "behavior": "Mobile Compact",
          "note": "Desktop-Hamburger auch auf Tablets ausgeblendet."
        }
      ],
      "drawerIntegration": {
        "trigger": ".nc-mobile-toggle click",
        "target": ".nc-header.is-mobile-open .nc-mobile-panel",
        "alternative": "Shell Drawer via nc-shell--sidebar-left-drawer-open",
        "contentTransfer": "Nav-Links (Molekuele) werden vertikal gestapelt, nutzen dieselben nav-atoms."
      }
    }
  },
  "specimens": [
    {
      "id": "full-composition",
      "label": "Full Header Composition",
      "description": "5-Ebenen-Komposition: Shell-Slot → Header → Menu → Links → Icons",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "viewport": [
            "desktop"
          ],
          "density": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "scrolled",
          "hidden"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "single",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "nav-orchestration-full",
        "label": "full-composition"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Skip-Link, aria-label auf nav, roving tabindex, keyboard-navigation."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "token-cascade",
      "label": "Token Cascade Visualization",
      "description": "Zeigt den Datenfluss: Shell-Z → Nav-Height → Mol-Hover → Atom-Icon",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "viewport": [
            "desktop"
          ],
          "density": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "single",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "nav-orchestration-cascade",
        "label": "token-cascade"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Informationell — keine interaktiven Elemente."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mobile-handoff",
      "label": "Mobile Handoff",
      "description": "Desktop-Menu → Hamburger → Drawer mit vertikalen Links",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "viewport": [
            "mobile"
          ],
          "density": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "mobile-open"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "nav-orchestration-mobile",
        "label": "mobile"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Focus-Trap im Drawer, aria-expanded auf Toggle."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "compact-density",
      "label": "Compact Density",
      "description": "Reduzierte Hoehe fuer Dashboard-Layouts",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "viewport": [
            "desktop"
          ],
          "density": [
            "compact"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "single",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "nav-orchestration-compact",
        "label": "compact"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Touch-Targets: min 44px trotz compact."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "z-index-governance",
      "label": "Z-Index Governance",
      "description": "Shell-Z-Schichten: Linkbar < Footerbar < Navbar < Sidebar < Overlay < Drawer",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "viewport": [
            "desktop"
          ],
          "density": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "single",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "nav-orchestration-z-index",
        "label": "z-index"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Informationell — visuelle Schichtdarstellung."
      }
    }
  ]
}
